coming online.

00:23:53.540 --> 00:23:56.650
There's a lot more interest
in Google Cloud Platform.

00:23:56.650 --> 00:24:01.220
And the commitment that Google
have offered for the partner

00:24:01.220 --> 00:24:03.980
ecosystem-- we can see that
that's starting to build out.

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:06.950
And GCP-- it really offers
some compelling services

00:24:06.950 --> 00:24:10.940
to Australian customers that you
don't get on any of the rest.

00:24:10.940 --> 00:24:12.530
We are platform agnostic.

00:24:12.530 --> 00:24:14.280
So we work on both platforms.

00:24:14.280 --> 00:24:18.200
But the differentiator that
I see as a Google Developer

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:21.290
Expert is definitely
the data analytics side

00:24:21.290 --> 00:24:25.730
of things and the machine
learning on AI on GCP.

00:24:25.730 --> 00:24:30.980
So absolutely it opens
a lot more doors for us

00:24:30.980 --> 00:24:33.890
