00:24:42.380 --> 00:24:46.190
We can now say it can be
stored in region in Sydney.

00:24:46.190 --> 00:24:49.730
So it's definitely--
it's an exciting time.

00:24:49.730 --> 00:24:52.270
There's a lot of potential
for Shine, more customers,

00:24:52.270 --> 00:24:54.380
and we're really,
really excited about it.

